  "title": "Baked Penne and Smoked Sausage",
  "description": "Hillshire Farm® Smoked Sausage is baked in a creamy sauce with pasta, French-fried onions, cheese, and peas in this easy one-dish meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Hillshire FarmR Brand"
  ],
